，前两局握手言和，第三局....'}, 'long_summary': '印度新德里举行的2026年羽毛球世锦赛，已经进入到了正赛第四个比赛日的争夺，国羽女单主力韩悦，再度登场迎来了1/8决赛的考验，对阵韩国名将金佳恩，本场比赛两名选手打得难解难分，前两局握手言和，第三局韩悦开局猛如虎，并且扛住了对手的殊死一搏，以2-1击败金佳恩晋级。作为本届赛会的女单12号种子，金佳恩前两轮的表现非常强势，连续横扫了来自埃及的尤斯利和匈牙利选手桑多尔哈齐，相比之下，韩悦的晋级之路略显坎坷，首战艰难逆转苏格兰一姐吉尔莫，好在上一场找回状态，干净利落以2-0淘汰了德国名将李怡逢。'}], 'news724_feature': None, 'safe_control': None, 'category': None}, {'id': '20260820A0BIJF00', 'articletype': '0', 'title': '“卓越且伟大”的许家印 楼起楼塌何其快也', 'pic_style': 0, 'publish_time': '2026-08-20 17:36:21', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OBoAJqEejw_cinaa1sv2b9HDhPIoytUPEPlk5osO94_QIAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OBoAJqEejw_cinaa1sv2b9HDhPIoytUPEPlk5osO94_QIAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OBoAJqEejw_cinaa1sv2b9HDhPIoytUPEPlk5osO94_QIAA_197130/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OBoAJqEejw_cinaa1sv2b9HDhPIoytUPEPlk5osO94_QIAA_196130/0', '360x240': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OBoAJqEejw_cinaa1sv2b9HDhPIoytUPEPlk5osO94_QIAA_360240/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OBoAJqEejw_cinaa1sv2b9HDhPIoytUPEPlk5osO94_QIAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/O9K7c7EDLBlP30dTho4RqJ1x15CRfUcRg4EtfTWLoCc_AAA_240240/0', 'img_count': 4}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820A0BIJF00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260820A0BIJF00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820A0BIJF00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820A0BIJF00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '5862502', 'chl_name': 'Dream梦体育', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/2117995025_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/2117995025_200200/0', 'mrk': '一个专注于体育领域的账号，希望能带给大家一些不一样的内容', 'last_art_update': '1787218581', 'uin': 'ec828fbf2e6d6da2ccbc1b0fde2ae4f35c', 'encoded_suid': '8QMZ3HpY5IUVujY=', 'vip_type': '30011', 'vip_type_new': '30011', 'vip_desc': '体育领域创作者', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876048581