，但规则也允许对其进行停赛处罚。去年2月，梅西就曾因“违规用手触碰对手面部、头部或颈部”被美职联罚款。'}, {'id': '20260820A082GE00', 'articletype': '0', 'title': '许家印被判无期徒刑！62岁副手套现1亿跑到美国 5年拿10亿薪水', 'pic_style': 0, 'publish_time': '2026-08-20 14:10:59', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O3bGya-q5Xn89ZpkNLK_62CEpp0jWu2yLmbdHtv7wTnIMAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O3bGya-q5Xn89ZpkNLK_62CEpp0jWu2yLmbdHtv7wTnIMAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O3bGya-q5Xn89ZpkNLK_62CEpp0jWu2yLmbdHtv7wTnIMAA_197130/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O3bGya-q5Xn89ZpkNLK_62CEpp0jWu2yLmbdHtv7wTnIMAA_196130/0', '360x240': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O3bGya-q5Xn89ZpkNLK_62CEpp0jWu2yLmbdHtv7wTnIMAA_360240/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O3bGya-q5Xn89ZpkNLK_62CEpp0jWu2yLmbdHtv7wTnIMAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OLbH9t2S5jbphDFUmkREX1AlAq-VUw_s1OyX-h9gZDSuoAA_240240/0', 'img_count': 3}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820A082GE00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260820A082GE00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820A082GE00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260820A082GE00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '5107133', 'chl_name': '念洲', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/12519335436_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/12519335436_200200/0', 'mrk': '腾讯国际足球频道资深撰稿人，《英伦传奇》、《欧冠之王C罗》、《绝境之神》作者', 'last_art_update': '0', 'uin': 'ec1ef4f71448c8f43619e2ff9bb0d8a0d9', 'encoded_suid': '8QMb2X1V5I0Yujo=', 'vip_type': '30013', 'vip_type_new': '30013', 'vip_desc': '英超评论员，腾讯足球特约撰稿人 体育领域创作者', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876049251/0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 53, 'medal_id': 85, 'medal_level': 1, 'medal_name': '热问内行人答主', 'medal_desc': '热问内行人答主专属勋章', 'night_url': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_bt/0/0120102343818_9444/0', 'daytime_url': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_bt/0/0120102343818_9444/0'}}, 